static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410850/extras/88560a8290474fd06eddd56272f9454f.mp4?t=1697552868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410850/extras/e4c222c55e9f82a3cf18fe79b29ff80c.webp?t=1697552868\" /></span><br>In Stellar Serenity, <strong>there isn't just one way to do things</strong>: You can prioritize the fast and efficient processing of materials with specific upgrades, or you can simply immerse yourself in the environment that only the vastness of space can offer and process the materials at your own pace.",
